<title>USA: Kash n' Karry ends Goodings supply pact.</title>
<headline>Kash n' Karry ends Goodings supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kash n' Karry Food Stores Inc said on Friday that it has agreed in principle to end a supply agreement with Gooding's Supermarkets, a 17-store Orlando, Florida-based chain.</p>
<p>The company said it will end shipments to Gooding's later this month.</p>
<p>It said that ending the agreement &quot;will not have a material impact on either company.&quot;</p>
</text>
